---
/**
 * The book still life (IOS_SPEC 2.5): the site's one linen mat, recessed by
 * its inset hairline, with Replaceable standing on it in perspective, a
 * contact shadow on the linen and the object shadow behind it, both clipped
 * to the mat. The book is one flat plane turned in perspective with its
 * binding drawn along the left edge (a preserve-3d spine loses the book's
 * lower half in Chromium when its top is scrolled out of view). The cover
 * slot stays exactly as the README says: when the approved cover arrives it
 * is dropped at public/images/replaceable-cover.jpg and the `src` below
 * changes; nothing else moves. The page sizes the mat and the book.
 */
---
<div class="mat io-bookmat rise-obj" style="--d:.3s">
  <i class="io-book-floor" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  <figure class="io-book" role="img" aria-label="The cover of Replaceable.">
    <span class="io-book-spine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="io-book-face">
      <img src="/images/replaceable-cover.svg" alt="" width="360" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </span>
  </figure>
</div>
